{"module":"before-race","voice":"female","duration":536.0,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"Antes de la raza: de dónde vino el miedo","start":0.0,"end":2.8,"words":[[0.09,0.46],[0.46,0.62],[0.62,0.77],[0.77,1.14],[1.4,1.55],[1.55,1.93],[1.93,2.23],[2.23,2.38],[2.38,2.75]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Mucha gente pregunta por qué el acoso contra las personas negras, morenas e indígenas ha durado tanto, y si algún origen olvidado lo explica.","start":3.6,"end":13.11,"words":[[3.66,4.02],[4.02,4.38],[4.38,4.96],[4.96,5.17],[5.17,5.32],[5.32,5.46],[5.46,5.82],[5.82,6.26],[6.26,6.47],[6.47,7.05],[7.05,7.55],[7.81,8.31],[8.31,8.38],[8.38,9.03],[9.03,9.11],[9.11,9.54],[9.54,9.97],[10.22,10.3],[10.3,10.44],[10.44,10.8],[10.8,11.23],[11.23,11.81],[11.81,11.96],[11.96,12.61]]},{"el":"intro","text":"El registro da una respuesta más clara: la raza moderna es reciente, se escribió en la ley a propósito, y se ha defendido con cualquier argumento a mano, incluidas las escrituras y la ciencia.","start":13.46,"end":26.72,"words":[[13.58,13.73],[13.73,14.32],[14.32,14.47],[14.47,14.69],[14.69,15.36],[15.36,15.59],[15.59,16.03],[16.29,16.44],[16.44,16.74],[16.74,17.26],[17.26,17.41],[17.41,18.08],[18.34,18.49],[18.49,19.08],[19.08,19.23],[19.23,19.38],[19.38,19.61],[19.61,19.68],[19.68,20.42],[20.68,20.76],[20.76,20.91],[20.91,20.98],[20.98,21.65],[21.65,21.88],[21.88,22.47],[22.47,23.14],[23.14,23.22],[23.22,23.59],[23.85,24.52],[24.52,24.74],[24.74,25.49],[25.49,25.56],[25.56,25.71],[25.71,26.3]]},{"el":"h0","text":"El mundo antiguo clasificaba a las personas de otra manera","start":27.07,"end":30.51,"words":[[27.15,27.29],[27.29,27.63],[27.63,28.1],[28.1,28.85],[28.85,28.92],[28.92,29.12],[29.12,29.66],[29.66,29.8],[29.8,30.07],[30.07,30.48]]},{"el":"s0","text":"La esclavitud es antigua, pero durante la mayor parte de la historia no se basó en el color de la piel.","start":31.21,"end":37.39,"words":[[31.31,31.45],[31.45,32.11],[32.11,32.25],[32.25,32.78],[33.01,33.28],[33.28,33.74],[33.74,33.88],[33.88,34.21],[34.21,34.54],[34.54,34.68],[34.68,34.81],[34.81,35.28],[35.28,35.41],[35.41,35.54],[35.54,35.81],[35.81,35.94],[35.94,36.07],[36.07,36.41],[36.41,36.54],[36.54,36.67],[36.67,37.01]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Griegos, romanos, egipcios, africanos, árabes y europeos esclavizaron a personas capturadas en guerras, vendidas por deudas o nacidas de madres esclavizadas, y las personas esclavizadas venían de todas las regiones.","start":37.74,"end":53.88,"words":[[37.81,38.49],[38.75,39.36],[39.62,40.3],[40.57,41.32],[41.58,42.04],[42.04,42.11],[42.11,42.72],[42.72,43.62],[43.62,43.7],[43.7,44.3],[44.3,45.06],[45.06,45.21],[45.21,45.66],[45.92,46.53],[46.53,46.76],[46.76,47.21],[47.21,47.28],[47.28,47.81],[47.81,47.96],[47.96,48.42],[48.42,49.4],[49.66,49.74],[49.74,49.96],[49.96,50.57],[50.57,51.47],[51.47,52.0],[52.0,52.15],[52.15,52.53],[52.53,52.76],[52.76,53.44]]},{"el":"s0","text":"La palabra esclavo viene de eslavo, porque en la Edad Media se esclavizó a muchísimos europeos del este.","start":54.23,"end":60.81,"words":[[54.33,54.46],[54.46,54.93],[54.93,55.4],[55.4,55.74],[55.74,55.87],[55.87,56.35],[56.58,56.92],[56.92,57.05],[57.05,57.19],[57.19,57.45],[57.45,57.79],[57.79,57.93],[57.93,58.53],[58.53,58.6],[58.6,59.27],[59.27,59.81],[59.81,60.01],[60.01,60.35]]},{"el":"s0","text":"El historiador Frank Snowden mostró que los escritores griegos y romanos describían a los africanos con curiosidad y a veces admiración, sin la idea de una jerarquía racial fija.","start":61.16,"end":72.56,"words":[[61.26,61.4],[61.4,62.11],[62.11,62.47],[62.47,62.96],[62.96,63.39],[63.39,63.53],[63.53,63.74],[63.74,64.45],[64.45,65.02],[65.02,65.09],[65.09,65.59],[65.59,66.37],[66.37,66.44],[66.44,66.65],[66.65,67.29],[67.29,67.5],[67.5,68.21],[68.21,68.28],[68.28,68.35],[68.35,68.71],[68.71,69.49],[69.74,69.95],[69.95,70.09],[70.09,70.38],[70.38,70.52],[70.52,70.73],[70.73,71.37],[71.37,71.8],[71.8,72.15]]},{"el":"h1","text":"La raza se escribió en la ley (1452–1705)","start":73.46,"end":78.4,"words":[[73.55,73.68],[73.68,73.93],[73.93,74.06],[74.06,74.57],[74.57,74.7],[74.7,74.82],[74.82,75.01],[75.01,78.13]]},{"el":"s1","text":"La idea de que algunas personas están naturalmente destinadas a ser poseídas se fue escribiendo paso a paso:","start":79.1,"end":85.74,"words":[[79.15,79.29],[79.29,79.57],[79.57,79.71],[79.71,79.85],[79.85,80.34],[80.34,80.9],[80.9,81.25],[81.25,82.09],[82.09,82.8],[82.8,82.87],[82.87,83.08],[83.08,83.64],[83.64,83.78],[83.78,83.99],[83.99,84.76],[84.76,85.04],[85.04,85.11],[85.11,85.47]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1452–1455: las bulas Dum Diversas y Romanus Pontifex del papa Nicolás V autorizaron al rey de Portugal a conquistar a “sarracenos y paganos” y reducirlos a esclavitud perpetua.","start":86.09,"end":101.03,"words":[[86.2,90.61],[90.86,91.08],[91.08,91.43],[91.43,91.65],[91.65,92.22],[92.22,92.29],[92.29,92.79],[92.79,93.43],[93.43,93.64],[93.64,93.93],[93.93,94.43],[94.43,94.57],[94.57,95.35],[95.35,95.5],[95.5,95.71],[95.71,95.85],[95.85,96.42],[96.42,96.49],[96.49,97.13],[97.13,97.21],[97.21,97.85],[97.85,97.92],[97.92,98.42],[98.42,98.49],[98.49,99.2],[99.2,99.27],[99.27,99.99],[99.99,100.63]]},{"el":"s1","text":"La trata portuguesa de africanos creció bajo ellas.","start":101.38,"end":104.8,"words":[[101.45,101.59],[101.59,101.93],[101.93,102.55],[102.55,102.69],[102.69,103.31],[103.31,103.72],[103.72,103.99],[103.99,104.41]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1493: Inter caetera otorgó a España las tierras “descubiertas” en América.","start":105.15,"end":111.78,"words":[[105.27,107.27],[107.51,107.85],[107.85,108.34],[108.34,108.75],[108.75,108.82],[108.82,109.23],[109.23,109.44],[109.44,109.85],[109.85,110.68],[110.68,110.81],[110.81,111.36]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Estas bulas se convirtieron en la Doctrina del Descubrimiento, que la Corte Suprema de EE. UU. adoptó en Johnson v. M'Intosh (1823) para negar a las naciones indígenas la plena propiedad de su tierra.","start":112.13,"end":125.44,"words":[[112.23,112.55],[112.55,112.86],[112.86,112.98],[112.98,113.74],[113.74,113.86],[113.86,113.99],[113.99,114.49],[114.49,114.68],[114.68,115.62],[115.84,115.96],[115.96,116.09],[116.09,116.4],[116.4,116.84],[116.84,116.96],[116.96,117.15],[117.47,117.65],[117.97,118.34],[118.34,118.47],[118.47,118.84],[118.84,119.03],[119.35,119.85],[119.85,121.35],[121.57,121.82],[121.82,122.13],[122.13,122.2],[122.2,122.38],[122.38,122.89],[122.89,123.45],[123.45,123.58],[123.58,123.89],[123.89,124.45],[124.45,124.58],[124.58,124.7],[124.7,125.08]]},{"el":"s1","text":"El Vaticano repudió la doctrina en 2023.","start":125.79,"end":129.04,"words":[[125.92,126.04],[126.04,126.52],[126.52,126.95],[126.95,127.07],[127.07,127.55],[127.55,127.67],[127.67,128.7]]},{"el":"s1","text":"La Corte Suprema no.","start":129.39,"end":130.85,"words":[[129.48,129.6],[129.6,129.89],[129.89,130.3],[130.3,130.48]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1662: Virginia decidió que un hijo sigue la condición de la madre, así que los hijos de mujeres esclavizadas, incluidos los hijos de sus esclavizadores, nacían esclavizados.","start":131.2,"end":144.25,"words":[[131.31,133.14],[133.39,133.95],[133.95,134.44],[134.44,134.58],[134.58,134.72],[134.72,134.93],[134.93,135.22],[135.22,135.36],[135.36,135.99],[135.99,136.13],[136.13,136.27],[136.27,136.69],[136.94,137.15],[137.15,137.29],[137.29,137.5],[137.5,137.78],[137.78,137.92],[137.92,138.42],[138.42,139.33],[139.58,140.21],[140.21,140.42],[140.42,140.7],[140.7,140.84],[140.84,141.05],[141.05,142.11],[142.35,142.85],[142.85,143.76]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1667–1705: Virginia declaró que el bautismo no libera a un esclavo (1667), que matar a una persona esclavizada durante una “corrección” no era delito grave (1669), prohibió el matrimonio interracial (1691) y lo reunió todo en los códigos de esclavos de 1705.","start":144.6,"end":168.22,"words":[[144.69,147.97],[148.2,148.75],[148.75,149.23],[149.23,149.36],[149.36,149.5],[149.5,150.05],[150.05,150.18],[150.18,150.59],[150.59,150.66],[150.66,150.8],[150.8,151.27],[151.27,153.18],[153.42,153.56],[153.56,153.9],[153.9,153.97],[153.97,154.17],[154.17,154.65],[154.65,155.4],[155.4,155.88],[155.88,156.08],[156.08,156.7],[156.7,156.83],[156.83,157.04],[157.04,157.45],[157.45,157.79],[157.79,159.7],[159.94,160.42],[160.42,160.55],[160.55,161.23],[161.23,161.92],[161.92,163.69],[163.93,164.0],[164.0,164.13],[164.13,164.54],[164.54,164.82],[164.82,164.95],[164.95,165.16],[165.16,165.63],[165.63,165.77],[165.77,166.32],[166.32,166.45],[166.45,167.82]]},{"el":"s1","text":"El Code Noir de Francia (1685) hizo lo mismo en sus colonias.","start":168.57,"end":173.88,"words":[[168.68,168.81],[168.81,169.07],[169.07,169.33],[169.33,169.47],[169.47,169.93],[169.93,171.7],[171.93,172.13],[172.13,172.26],[172.26,172.59],[172.59,172.72],[172.72,172.92],[172.92,173.51]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Dividir a quienes podían unirse","start":174.78,"end":176.73,"words":[[174.86,175.34],[175.34,175.4],[175.4,175.81],[175.81,176.28],[176.28,176.69]]},{"el":"s2","text":"En 1676, la Rebelión de Bacon unió a sirvientes blancos por contrato y africanos esclavizados en una revuelta armada contra el gobierno de Virginia.","start":177.43,"end":187.89,"words":[[177.51,177.65],[177.65,179.43],[179.67,179.8],[179.8,180.33],[180.33,180.46],[180.46,180.79],[180.79,181.06],[181.06,181.12],[181.12,181.78],[181.78,182.25],[182.25,182.45],[182.45,182.98],[182.98,183.04],[183.04,183.64],[183.64,184.43],[184.43,184.57],[184.57,184.76],[184.76,185.29],[185.29,185.69],[185.69,186.09],[186.09,186.22],[186.22,186.75],[186.75,186.88],[186.88,187.48]]},{"el":"s2","text":"En las décadas siguientes, las leyes de Virginia dieron a los blancos pobres pequeños privilegios (pagos al terminar su servidumbre, el derecho a portar armas, el derecho a golpear a una persona negra) mientras quitaban derechos a todas las personas negras, libres o esclavizadas.","start":188.24,"end":205.93,"words":[[188.38,188.52],[188.52,188.73],[188.73,189.21],[189.21,189.9],[190.14,190.34],[190.34,190.69],[190.69,190.82],[190.82,191.37],[191.37,191.79],[191.79,191.85],[191.85,192.06],[192.06,192.54],[192.54,192.95],[192.95,193.44],[193.44,194.19],[194.19,194.53],[194.53,194.67],[194.67,195.22],[195.22,195.36],[195.36,196.18],[196.42,196.56],[196.56,197.04],[197.04,197.11],[197.11,197.52],[197.52,197.94],[198.18,198.31],[198.31,198.8],[198.8,198.86],[198.86,199.35],[199.35,199.41],[199.41,199.62],[199.62,200.1],[200.1,200.45],[200.69,201.24],[201.24,201.72],[201.72,202.27],[202.27,202.34],[202.34,202.68],[202.68,202.88],[202.88,203.43],[203.43,203.92],[204.16,204.57],[204.57,204.64],[204.64,205.53]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Que las leyes cambiaron está documentado.","start":206.28,"end":208.94,"words":[[206.36,206.48],[206.48,206.67],[206.67,206.99],[206.99,207.56],[207.56,207.81],[207.81,208.56]]},{"el":"s2","text":"El historiador Edmund Morgan sostuvo que la élite usó la raza a propósito para impedir que los blancos y negros pobres volvieran a unirse.","start":209.29,"end":217.34,"words":[[209.38,209.52],[209.52,210.19],[210.19,210.6],[210.6,211.0],[211.0,211.47],[211.47,211.61],[211.61,211.74],[211.74,212.08],[212.08,212.28],[212.28,212.42],[212.42,212.69],[212.69,212.75],[212.75,213.36],[213.36,213.63],[213.63,214.1],[214.1,214.24],[214.24,214.44],[214.44,214.91],[214.91,214.98],[214.98,215.38],[215.38,215.78],[215.78,216.39],[216.39,216.46],[216.46,216.93]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Otros creen que el cambio se debió más a que los africanos esclavizados se volvieron más baratos que los sirvientes ingleses.","start":217.69,"end":225.23,"words":[[217.76,218.1],[218.1,218.45],[218.45,218.58],[218.58,218.72],[218.72,219.13],[219.13,219.27],[219.27,219.61],[219.61,219.82],[219.82,219.88],[219.88,220.02],[220.02,220.23],[220.23,220.84],[220.84,221.66],[221.66,221.8],[221.8,222.42],[222.42,222.62],[222.62,223.1],[223.1,223.24],[223.24,223.44],[223.44,224.13],[224.13,224.74]]},{"el":"s2","text":"La mayoría coincide en que el efecto fue el mismo.","start":225.58,"end":229.11,"words":[[225.67,225.82],[225.82,226.41],[226.41,227.0],[227.0,227.15],[227.15,227.3],[227.3,227.45],[227.45,227.89],[227.89,228.12],[228.12,228.26],[228.26,228.71]]},{"el":"h3","text":"Primero la práctica, después las ideas","start":230.01,"end":233.4,"words":[[230.1,230.71],[230.71,230.89],[230.89,231.69],[231.99,232.61],[232.61,232.88],[232.88,233.32]]},{"el":"s3","text":"En 1944, el historiador trinitense Eric Williams escribió que “la esclavitud no nació del racismo: más bien, el racismo fue consecuencia de la esclavitud”.","start":234.1,"end":245.5,"words":[[234.18,234.31],[234.31,236.31],[236.54,236.67],[236.67,237.34],[237.34,238.0],[238.0,238.27],[238.27,238.87],[238.87,239.4],[239.4,239.53],[239.53,239.66],[239.66,240.33],[240.33,240.46],[240.46,240.79],[240.79,240.99],[240.99,241.53],[241.76,241.96],[241.96,242.29],[242.52,242.66],[242.66,243.12],[243.12,243.32],[243.32,244.12],[244.12,244.25],[244.25,244.39],[244.39,245.12]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Stamped from the Beginning (2016) de Ibram X. Kendi sigue el mismo patrón durante cinco siglos: las ideas racistas se desarrollaron para defender políticas que ya eran rentables.","start":245.85,"end":257.95,"words":[[245.91,246.39],[246.39,246.66],[246.66,246.8],[246.8,247.35],[247.35,248.37],[248.61,248.75],[248.75,249.09],[249.09,249.44],[249.78,250.12],[250.12,250.4],[250.4,250.53],[250.53,250.88],[250.88,251.29],[251.29,251.77],[251.77,252.11],[252.11,252.59],[252.83,253.03],[253.03,253.38],[253.38,253.93],[253.93,254.06],[254.06,254.89],[254.89,255.16],[255.16,255.71],[255.71,256.32],[256.32,256.46],[256.46,256.6],[256.6,256.87],[256.87,257.56]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Thomas Jefferson, que esclavizó a más de 600 personas a lo largo de su vida, planteó la inferioridad negra “solo como una sospecha” en sus Notas sobre el estado de Virginia (1785).","start":258.3,"end":271.23,"words":[[258.43,258.77],[258.77,259.45],[259.69,259.83],[259.83,260.44],[260.44,260.51],[260.51,260.72],[260.72,260.86],[260.86,261.61],[261.61,262.16],[262.16,262.22],[262.22,262.36],[262.36,262.7],[262.7,262.84],[262.84,262.98],[262.98,263.32],[263.56,264.04],[264.04,264.17],[264.17,265.0],[265.0,265.34],[265.34,265.61],[265.61,265.89],[265.89,266.09],[266.09,266.64],[266.64,266.78],[266.78,266.98],[266.98,267.32],[267.32,267.67],[267.67,267.8],[267.8,268.21],[268.21,268.35],[268.35,268.9],[268.9,270.81]]},{"el":"s3","text":"En pocas décadas, “científicos” medían cráneos para probarlo (ver el módulo sobre la ciencia).","start":271.58,"end":277.58,"words":[[271.65,271.78],[271.78,272.12],[272.12,272.66],[272.9,273.65],[273.65,274.12],[274.12,274.59],[274.59,274.86],[274.86,275.41],[275.41,275.61],[275.61,275.75],[275.75,276.15],[276.15,276.49],[276.49,276.63],[276.63,277.17]]},{"el":"h4","text":"De qué se trataba realmente el miedo","start":278.48,"end":281.04,"words":[[278.57,278.74],[278.74,278.91],[278.91,279.07],[279.07,279.66],[279.66,280.41],[280.41,280.58],[280.58,281.0]]},{"el":"s4","text":"El miedo era real.","start":281.74,"end":283.3,"words":[[281.85,281.99],[281.99,282.34],[282.34,282.55],[282.55,282.9]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Era miedo a la rebelión, a la venganza y a perder el poder en las urnas:","start":283.65,"end":288.65,"words":[[283.79,284.01],[284.01,284.37],[284.37,284.44],[284.44,284.59],[284.59,285.24],[285.5,285.57],[285.57,285.71],[285.71,286.29],[286.29,286.37],[286.37,286.44],[286.44,286.87],[286.87,287.02],[287.02,287.38],[287.38,287.53],[287.53,287.74],[287.74,288.18]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Haití, 1791–1804: las personas esclavizadas derrocaron el dominio francés y fundaron la primera república negra libre.","start":289.0,"end":299.46,"words":[[289.11,289.46],[289.69,292.97],[293.21,293.41],[293.41,293.96],[293.96,294.77],[294.77,295.39],[295.39,295.52],[295.52,296.0],[296.0,296.48],[296.48,296.55],[296.55,297.09],[297.09,297.23],[297.23,297.71],[297.71,298.32],[298.32,298.66],[298.66,299.07]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Después, Francia obligó a Haití a pagar 150 millones de francos (rebajados a 90 millones) por su propia libertad, una deuda que Haití pagó durante unos 120 años.","start":299.81,"end":311.88,"words":[[299.91,300.46],[300.7,301.19],[301.19,301.6],[301.6,301.67],[301.67,301.95],[301.95,302.02],[302.02,302.37],[302.37,303.41],[303.41,303.96],[303.96,304.1],[304.1,304.59],[304.59,305.21],[305.21,305.28],[305.28,305.77],[305.77,306.32],[306.56,306.77],[306.77,306.91],[306.91,307.33],[307.33,307.95],[308.19,308.4],[308.4,308.75],[308.75,308.89],[308.89,309.16],[309.16,309.44],[309.44,309.93],[309.93,310.2],[310.2,311.04],[311.04,311.38]]},{"el":"s4","text":"La rebelión de Nat Turner, 1831: después, Virginia y otros estados endurecieron las prohibiciones de enseñar a leer a las personas negras y de los predicadores y reuniones negros.","start":312.23,"end":325.49,"words":[[312.35,312.49],[312.49,313.05],[313.05,313.19],[313.19,313.4],[313.4,313.89],[314.13,316.02],[316.26,316.82],[317.07,317.62],[317.62,317.69],[317.69,318.04],[318.04,318.53],[318.53,319.37],[319.37,319.58],[319.58,320.42],[320.42,320.56],[320.56,321.05],[321.05,321.12],[321.12,321.4],[321.4,321.47],[321.47,321.68],[321.68,322.24],[322.24,322.66],[322.66,322.73],[322.73,322.86],[322.86,323.07],[323.07,323.91],[323.91,323.98],[323.98,324.61],[324.61,325.1]]},{"el":"s4","text":"La Reconstrucción, 1867–1877: los hombres negros votaron y ocuparon cargos, y la cámara baja de Carolina del Sur tuvo mayoría negra.","start":325.84,"end":337.52,"words":[[325.95,326.08],[326.08,327.08],[327.31,331.03],[331.26,331.46],[331.46,331.85],[331.85,332.25],[332.25,332.72],[332.72,332.78],[332.78,333.31],[333.31,333.78],[334.01,334.08],[334.08,334.21],[334.21,334.61],[334.61,334.87],[334.87,335.01],[335.01,335.54],[335.54,335.74],[335.74,335.94],[335.94,336.2],[336.2,336.73],[336.73,337.13]]},{"el":"s4","text":"La violencia supremacista blanca le puso fin, incluido el golpe de 1898 en Wilmington, Carolina del Norte, donde un gobierno birracial electo fue derrocado por la fuerza.","start":337.87,"end":350.92,"words":[[337.95,338.09],[338.09,338.74],[338.74,339.6],[339.6,340.03],[340.03,340.17],[340.17,340.46],[340.46,340.74],[340.99,341.57],[341.57,341.71],[341.71,342.07],[342.07,342.21],[342.21,344.14],[344.14,344.29],[344.29,345.08],[345.33,345.9],[345.9,346.11],[346.11,346.54],[346.8,347.15],[347.15,347.3],[347.3,347.87],[347.87,348.44],[348.44,348.87],[348.87,349.09],[349.09,349.66],[349.66,349.88],[349.88,350.02],[350.02,350.52]]},{"el":"s4","text":"El “reemplazo”: The Passing of the Great Race (1916) de Madison Grant advirtió que los blancos estadounidenses estaban siendo superados en número.","start":351.27,"end":361.32,"words":[[351.38,351.51],[351.51,352.18],[352.41,352.55],[352.55,352.95],[352.95,353.08],[353.08,353.21],[353.21,353.55],[353.55,353.82],[353.82,355.35],[355.59,355.72],[355.72,356.19],[356.19,356.52],[356.52,357.06],[357.06,357.19],[357.19,357.39],[357.39,357.86],[357.86,358.86],[358.86,359.33],[359.33,359.73],[359.73,360.33],[360.33,360.46],[360.46,360.93]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Ayudó a aprobar las cuotas migratorias de 1924.","start":361.67,"end":365.92,"words":[[361.75,362.06],[362.06,362.12],[362.12,362.56],[362.56,362.74],[362.74,363.11],[363.11,363.79],[363.79,363.92],[363.92,365.58]]},{"el":"s4","text":"El mismo miedo, rebautizado como el “Gran Reemplazo”, fue citado por los asesinos de El Paso (2019) y Buffalo (2022).","start":366.27,"end":375.65,"words":[[366.37,366.51],[366.51,366.87],[366.87,367.29],[367.54,368.31],[368.31,368.6],[368.6,368.74],[368.74,369.02],[369.02,369.73],[369.97,370.19],[370.19,370.61],[370.61,370.82],[370.82,371.03],[371.03,371.6],[371.6,371.74],[371.74,371.88],[371.88,372.16],[372.16,373.29],[373.54,373.61],[373.61,374.11],[374.11,375.24]]},{"el":"h5","text":"Cómo se usaron, y se tergiversaron, las escrituras","start":376.55,"end":380.56,"words":[[376.65,376.96],[376.96,377.11],[377.11,377.65],[377.92,378.0],[378.0,378.15],[378.15,379.23],[379.49,379.73],[379.73,380.49]]},{"el":"s5","text":"La “maldición de Cam”.","start":381.26,"end":382.69,"words":[[381.37,381.48],[381.48,382.0],[382.0,382.12],[382.12,382.35]]},{"el":"s5","text":"En Génesis 9:20–27, Noé maldice a Canaán, hijo de Cam, para que sea siervo.","start":383.04,"end":389.92,"words":[[383.13,383.27],[383.27,383.78],[383.78,385.53],[385.79,386.01],[386.01,386.52],[386.52,386.59],[386.59,387.1],[387.36,387.58],[387.58,387.72],[387.72,388.01],[388.27,388.56],[388.56,388.71],[388.71,388.93],[388.93,389.44]]},{"el":"s5","text":"El texto no dice nada sobre el color de la piel ni sobre África.","start":390.27,"end":394.29,"words":[[390.36,390.5],[390.5,390.9],[390.9,391.04],[391.04,391.31],[391.31,391.58],[391.58,391.92],[391.92,392.05],[392.05,392.39],[392.39,392.53],[392.53,392.66],[392.66,392.93],[392.93,393.07],[393.07,393.41],[393.41,393.88]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Vincular la maldición con la piel oscura vino mucho después y se difundió por intérpretes de varias tradiciones.","start":394.64,"end":401.41,"words":[[394.7,395.23],[395.23,395.36],[395.36,395.96],[395.96,396.16],[396.16,396.3],[396.3,396.56],[396.56,396.96],[396.96,397.23],[397.23,397.56],[397.56,398.03],[398.03,398.1],[398.1,398.23],[398.23,398.76],[398.76,398.96],[398.96,399.7],[399.7,399.83],[399.83,400.23],[400.23,401.03]]},{"el":"s5","text":"En el siglo XIX era un argumento proesclavista habitual en los púlpitos estadounidenses.","start":401.76,"end":407.26,"words":[[401.85,401.97],[401.97,402.09],[402.09,402.4],[402.4,403.02],[403.02,403.2],[403.2,403.33],[403.33,403.88],[403.88,404.68],[404.68,405.12],[405.12,405.24],[405.24,405.42],[405.42,405.92],[405.92,406.91]]},{"el":"s5","text":"La “Biblia del esclavo”.","start":407.61,"end":409.2,"words":[[407.76,407.86],[407.86,408.23],[408.23,408.38],[408.38,408.8]]},{"el":"s5","text":"En 1807, una sociedad misionera británica imprimió Select Parts of the Holy Bible, for the Use of the Negro Slaves.","start":409.55,"end":419.5,"words":[[409.63,409.79],[409.79,411.45],[411.74,411.98],[411.98,412.64],[412.64,413.39],[413.39,414.13],[414.13,414.79],[414.79,415.29],[415.29,415.7],[415.7,415.86],[415.86,416.03],[416.03,416.28],[416.28,416.77],[417.06,417.31],[417.31,417.48],[417.48,417.72],[417.72,417.89],[417.89,418.05],[418.05,418.47],[418.47,419.04]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Eliminó la mayor parte del Antiguo Testamento, incluido el relato del Éxodo y la liberación de la esclavitud, y conservó pasajes como “Siervos, obedeced a vuestros amos”.","start":419.85,"end":431.13,"words":[[419.92,420.41],[420.41,420.55],[420.55,420.9],[420.9,421.26],[421.26,421.47],[421.47,421.96],[421.96,422.73],[422.98,423.54],[423.54,423.68],[423.68,424.11],[424.11,424.32],[424.32,424.74],[424.74,424.81],[424.81,424.95],[424.95,425.66],[425.66,425.8],[425.8,425.94],[425.94,426.71],[426.96,427.03],[427.03,427.59],[427.59,428.08],[428.08,428.36],[428.36,428.93],[429.17,429.74],[429.74,429.81],[429.81,430.37],[430.37,430.72]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Las escrituras también fueron el arma más fuerte contra la esclavitud: las personas esclavizadas cantaban sobre Moisés y el Éxodo, y los abolicionistas, desde Frederick Douglass hasta la iglesia negra, basaron en ellas su causa.","start":431.48,"end":446.98,"words":[[431.59,431.81],[431.81,432.54],[432.54,433.04],[433.04,433.48],[433.48,433.62],[433.62,433.91],[433.91,434.13],[434.13,434.56],[434.56,435.0],[435.0,435.14],[435.14,435.94],[436.19,436.41],[436.41,436.99],[436.99,437.86],[437.86,438.43],[438.43,438.8],[438.8,439.23],[439.23,439.3],[439.3,439.45],[439.45,439.95],[440.21,440.28],[440.28,440.5],[440.5,441.58],[441.84,442.2],[442.2,442.78],[442.78,443.36],[443.36,443.65],[443.65,443.79],[443.79,444.3],[444.3,444.73],[444.99,445.49],[445.49,445.64],[445.64,446.0],[446.0,446.14],[446.14,446.58]]},{"el":"h6","text":"El Libro de Enoc y los mitos raciales modernos","start":447.88,"end":451.08,"words":[[447.97,448.13],[448.13,448.53],[448.53,448.69],[448.69,449.01],[449.01,449.09],[449.09,449.33],[449.33,449.73],[449.73,450.37],[450.37,451.01]]},{"el":"s6","text":"1 Enoc es un antiguo libro judío que forma parte de la Biblia de la Iglesia Ortodoxa Etíope; se hallaron fragmentos entre los Rollos del Mar Muerto, y la Carta de Judas (versículos 14–15) lo cita.","start":451.78,"end":464.94,"words":[[451.87,452.08],[452.08,452.36],[452.36,452.5],[452.5,452.63],[452.63,453.12],[453.12,453.47],[453.47,453.89],[453.89,454.03],[454.03,454.38],[454.38,454.73],[454.73,454.87],[454.87,455.01],[455.01,455.5],[455.5,455.64],[455.64,455.78],[455.78,456.27],[456.27,456.9],[456.9,457.46],[457.7,457.84],[457.84,458.33],[458.33,459.03],[459.03,459.38],[459.38,459.59],[459.59,460.01],[460.01,460.22],[460.22,460.43],[460.43,460.91],[461.16,461.23],[461.23,461.37],[461.37,461.72],[461.72,461.86],[461.86,462.21],[462.21,462.91],[462.91,463.81],[464.06,464.2],[464.2,464.55]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Cuenta cómo unos ángeles llamados los Vigilantes bajaron a la tierra, enseñaron conocimientos prohibidos y engendraron gigantes (los Nefilim de Génesis 6).","start":465.29,"end":475.58,"words":[[465.39,465.82],[465.82,466.11],[466.11,466.39],[466.39,466.9],[466.9,467.4],[467.4,467.61],[467.61,468.33],[468.33,468.83],[468.83,468.9],[468.9,469.04],[469.04,469.47],[469.72,470.37],[470.37,471.3],[471.3,471.94],[471.94,472.01],[472.01,472.8],[472.8,473.37],[473.37,473.59],[473.59,474.09],[474.09,474.23],[474.23,474.73],[474.73,475.09]]},{"el":"s6","text":"No contiene ninguna enseñanza sobre la raza.","start":475.93,"end":478.9,"words":[[476.0,476.13],[476.13,476.66],[476.66,477.12],[477.12,477.71],[477.71,478.04],[478.04,478.17],[478.17,478.5]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Aun así, movimientos modernos han construido historias raciales sobre el Génesis y Enoc.","start":479.25,"end":485.38,"words":[[479.35,479.57],[479.57,479.86],[480.11,480.91],[480.91,481.48],[481.48,481.63],[481.63,482.35],[482.35,482.93],[482.93,483.51],[483.51,483.87],[483.87,484.02],[484.02,484.52],[484.52,484.59],[484.59,484.96]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Las describimos para que puedas reconocerlas, no porque sean ciertas:","start":485.73,"end":490.35,"words":[[485.84,486.05],[486.05,486.8],[486.8,487.08],[487.08,487.22],[487.22,487.63],[487.63,488.52],[488.76,488.9],[488.9,489.24],[489.24,489.52],[489.52,490.07]]},{"el":"s6","text":"La teología de las “dos simientes” de Christian Identity, una doctrina supremacista blanca que afirma que los judíos y las personas de color descienden de la serpiente o de razas “preadámicas”.","start":490.7,"end":501.78,"words":[[490.79,490.92],[490.92,491.51],[491.51,491.65],[491.65,491.84],[491.84,492.04],[492.04,492.63],[492.63,492.76],[492.76,493.35],[493.35,493.94],[494.17,494.37],[494.37,494.9],[494.9,495.68],[495.68,496.08],[496.08,496.21],[496.21,496.6],[496.6,496.74],[496.74,496.93],[496.93,497.39],[497.39,497.46],[497.46,497.65],[497.65,498.18],[498.18,498.31],[498.31,498.64],[498.64,499.23],[499.23,499.36],[499.36,499.49],[499.49,500.08],[500.08,500.15],[500.15,500.28],[500.28,500.61],[500.61,501.4]]},{"el":"s6","text":"La historia de Yakub de la Nación del Islam, que enseña que un científico llamado Yakub creó a los blancos hace miles de años.","start":502.13,"end":509.95,"words":[[502.2,502.34],[502.34,502.85],[502.85,502.99],[502.99,503.35],[503.35,503.5],[503.5,503.64],[503.64,504.08],[504.08,504.29],[504.29,504.73],[504.98,505.12],[505.12,505.56],[505.56,505.7],[505.7,505.85],[505.85,506.57],[506.57,507.0],[507.0,507.36],[507.36,507.65],[507.65,507.72],[507.72,507.94],[507.94,508.45],[508.45,508.66],[508.66,509.02],[509.02,509.17],[509.17,509.53]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Algunos grupos israelitas hebreos enseñan que los negros, hispanos e indígenas americanos son los verdaderos israelitas y que los demás están malditos.","start":510.3,"end":519.85,"words":[[510.39,510.88],[510.88,511.3],[511.3,512.0],[512.0,512.42],[512.42,512.91],[512.91,513.05],[513.05,513.26],[513.26,513.75],[514.0,514.48],[514.48,514.55],[514.55,515.18],[515.18,515.88],[515.88,516.09],[516.09,516.3],[516.3,517.0],[517.0,517.7],[517.7,517.77],[517.77,517.91],[517.91,518.12],[518.12,518.47],[518.47,518.82],[518.82,519.45]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Estas historias se reflejan unas a otras: cada una afirma que la raza es antigua, fija y cósmica.","start":520.2,"end":527.12,"words":[[520.3,520.67],[520.67,521.26],[521.26,521.41],[521.41,522.01],[522.01,522.31],[522.31,522.38],[522.38,522.83],[523.09,523.39],[523.39,523.61],[523.61,524.06],[524.06,524.21],[524.21,524.36],[524.36,524.65],[524.65,524.8],[524.8,525.4],[525.66,525.96],[525.96,526.03],[526.03,526.63]]},{"el":"s6","text":"El registro histórico muestra lo contrario: la raza es reciente, la hicieron personas y se puede deshacer.","start":527.47,"end":535.13,"words":[[527.59,527.74],[527.74,528.34],[528.34,528.95],[528.95,529.48],[529.48,529.63],[529.63,530.39],[530.65,530.8],[530.8,531.1],[531.1,531.26],[531.26,531.94],[532.2,532.35],[532.35,532.88],[532.88,533.49],[533.49,533.56],[533.56,533.72],[533.72,534.09],[534.09,534.7]]}]}